# CONFIG NOTE (18 Sep 2026): originally `depends on TRUSTY && VXTUX_DRIVERS`,
# but 6.18 mainline DOES NOT have TRUSTY symbol (verified: no
# `config TRUSTY` in entire tree; drivers/trusty doesn't exist, only
# drivers/tee). As a result this symbol can never be enabled and =y line in defconfig
# dropped by olddefconfig without message. If trusty-ipc enters tree, that dep
# must be restored; disp_ca.c itself already fail-gracefully without TEE.
config VXTUX_TRUSTY_DISP
	tristate "VXTux: Trusty display-CA helpers (RE)"
	depends on TEE
	default n
	help
	  Helper disp_ca_* for Trusty TEE display path (proven stub build v4;
	  original provider = disp_trusty.c when TRUSTY_VIRTIO_IPC=y). Official port
	  replaces stub — fail-gracefully without TEE.
